===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# The condition of being [[fit]], [[suitable]] or [[appropriate]]
# the cultivation of an attractive and healthy physique
# the ability to perform a function

====Synonyms====
* (''cultivation of an...'') [[beauty]], [[health]]
* (''ability to perform'') [[strength]], [[suitability]], [[competence]], [[capability]]

====Antonyms====
* (''cultivation of an...'') [[flab]], [[sloth]]
* (''ability to perform'') [[weakness]]

